📖 Story
Tum aur tumhare friends adventure trip par boat se nikle the.
Raaste me achanak bahut bada tufaan aa gaya.
Boat crash hokar ek unknown island par pahunch gayi.
Boat toot gayi.
Ab ghar wapas jaane ka sirf ek hi rasta hai...
⛰️ Island ke sabse upar pahunchna.
Lekin...
Ye Monkey King ka island hai.
