👻 Soul Inheritance System
Monkey King kabhi sach me nahi marta.
Jab current Monkey King mar jata hai...
Uske purvajon ki sari atma uske bacche ke andar transfer ho jati hai.
Har Monkey King ke andar:
👴 Dada
👵 Dadi
👨 Papa
👩 Mummy
Aur puri Monkey Royal Family ki souls rehti hain.
Kabhi-kabhi control change ho jata hai.
Dadi bolti hai.
Fir Dada.
Fir Papa.
Fir Monkey King.
Isliye uski personality hamesha change hoti rehti hai.
